<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 68.70 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 68.70 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 68.700 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.687 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 11		  Sep 10</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     68.700		  68.687</p>
<p> volume ($ million)	   7.045		   3.155</p>
<p>				    Sep 11		  Sep 6</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.58		   46.36</p>
<p> volume (DM million)	  0.195		    0.100</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
